{"id":"4e6ae3cc72e7164b","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-davis-putnam-elimination.md","title":"清除重言子句后的变量消元","display":"df-davis-putnam-elimination — 清除重言子句后的变量消元","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination","aliases":["72-df-davis-putnam-elimination"],"display":"df-davis-putnam-elimination — 清除重言子句后的变量消元","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; source normalization made explicit","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-davis-putnam-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-davis-putnam-elimination — 清除重言子句后的变量消元"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; source normalization made explicit"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline l\">\\(\\overline l\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clean},\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Clean},\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p\\)</span> 在下式构造；集合差移除的是所示子句或变量，不是语法文字出现的非形式删除指令。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Clean}(F)&amp;:=\\{C\\in F:\\neg\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\overline l\\in C)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(F)&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists C\\in F\\ (q\\in C\\lor\\neg q\\in C)\\},\\\\\nF_p^0&amp;:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\notin C\\land\\neg p\\notin C\\},\\\\\nF_p^+&amp;:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\in C\\},\\qquad\nF_p^-:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):\\neg p\\in C\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)&amp;:=F_p^0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C,D,p):C\\in F_p^+,\\ D\\in F_p^-\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F))&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Vars}(F)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Clean}(F)&amp;:=\\{C\\in F:\\neg\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\overline l\\in C)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(F)&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists C\\in F\\ (q\\in C\\lor\\neg q\\in C)\\},\\\\\nF_p^0&amp;:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\notin C\\land\\neg p\\notin C\\},\\\\\nF_p^+&amp;:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\in C\\},\\qquad\nF_p^-:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):\\neg p\\in C\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)&amp;:=F_p^0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C,D,p):C\\in F_p^+,\\ D\\in F_p^-\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F))&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Vars}(F)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书允许先假设没有同时含某文字及其补文字的重言子句；这里把这一步做成显式集合构造。清理后正父子句不含负主文字，负父子句不含正主文字，所以归结子句中确实没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。其他变量不增加。结果中若出现其他变量形成的重言子句，可以保留；下一轮消元会再次清理。空输入、空子句和无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的输入都有确定输出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}$ 有限，$p\\in\\mathsf{PV}$；$\\overline l$、$\\operatorname{Res}$ 同 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline l","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Clean},\\operatorname{Vars},\\operatorname{DP}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Clean}(F)&:=\\{C\\in F:\\neg\\exists l\\in C\\ (\\overline l\\in C)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(F)&:=\\{q\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists C\\in F\\ (q\\in C\\lor\\neg q\\in C)\\},\\\\\nF_p^0&:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\notin C\\land\\neg p\\notin C\\},\\\\\nF_p^+&:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):p\\in C\\},\\qquad\nF_p^-:=\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Clean}(F):\\neg p\\in C\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)&:=F_p^0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C,D,p):C\\in F_p^+,\\ D\\in F_p^-\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Vars}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F))&\\subseteq\\operatorname{Vars}(F)\\setminus\\{p\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2133,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination|df-davis-putnam-elimination — 清除重言子句后的变量消元]]"},{"id":"1a1196fd5e373b39","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p$ 同 [[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]，$a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}$；子句和CNF满足关系取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。"},{"id":"44d3a4bd8308f551","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135"]}